{"id":"abe183f4d9817cd3","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-cor-cardinal-power.md","title":"Cardinal Power Corollary","display":"cor-cardinal-power — Cardinal Power Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-cardinal-power","aliases":["58-cor-cardinal-power"],"display":"cor-cardinal-power — Cardinal Power Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-cardinal-power"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-cardinal-power</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-cardinal-power — Cardinal Power Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d080919eadef61c1\" href=\"?note=d080919eadef61c1\" title=\"../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md\">../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> (power-set operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cardinal-power} \\vdash \\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to |\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|&gt;\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cardinal-power} \\vdash \\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\to |\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|&gt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the cardinal consequence of Cantor's theorem from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d080919eadef61c1\" href=\"?note=d080919eadef61c1\" title=\"../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md\">../batch11/58-thm-cantor.md</a>.</li>\n<li>With the standard identification <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa=|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|\">\\(2^\\kappa=|\\mathcal P(\\kappa)|\\)</span>, it says <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa&gt;\\kappa\">\\(2^\\kappa&gt;\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../ba